@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.8
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:那么，魔女审判现在开庭。|#0206Trial02_Yuki001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.9
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:首先从人类犯下的罪行<br>说起吧。|#0206Trial02_Yuki002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:人类肆虐橫行。|#0206Trial02_Yuki003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:他们将<br>原初的魔女<br>从这个世界<br>抹杀……|#0206Trial02_Yuki004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"对于此等自私而又残忍的蛮行，<br>本庭判断<br>毫无<link=\"Objection_02_06_02_01\">酌情处理</link>的余地。|#0206Trial02_Yuki005|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.15
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"人类罪大恶极，<br><link=\"Objection_02_06_02_02\">万死</link>仍有余辜。<br>|#0206Trial02_Yuki006|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.14
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……因此，<br>我在此宣布本次审判<br>对被告——人类的判决。|#0206Trial02_Yuki007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.10
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:判处——死刑。|#0206Trial02_Yuki008| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Yuki.6
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Yuki Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"刑罚立即执行。<br>不接受任何<link=\"Objection_02_06_02_03\">反驳</link>。|#0206Trial02_Yuki009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

